0 37 676 [
[(The [vline~] object generates linear ramps like [line~], but ramps may start)]
[(and stop within blocks and even between audio samples \050in which case the)]
[(output is interpolated accordingly\051. It takes a target value, a time interval)]
[(in milliseconds to reach it and an initial delay \050also in ms\051. This object can)]
[(also convert float to signals with more preciosion than [sig~] \050see [pd)]
[(details] below\051. Unlike [line~], it starts incrementing right away \050also see)]
[([pd details] below\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
